[
  {
    "ID": 1007412999,
    "key": "68080bfa124084683800b9785bbd673a0453daa5b9456b588f0fdb7fe845bdd7",
    "original": "A chieftain sleeps there with his entire warband around him. Or maybe they just pretend to sleep.",
    "translation": "一位酋长和他的整支战团沉睡于此。或者，他们只是假装在睡。",
    "context": "getroottable().Const.World.RF_LocationDescriptions.RF_DraugrFane = [\"Built into the mountain itself. Bigger than a lord's hall. But no fires burn within. Just echoes.\",\"That place was meant to last till the end of the world. Might be the dead inside think it already ended.\",\"They say kings lie there with their tribes. All of them with eyes that never close.\",\"The walls are carved with stories in stone. Kings, battles, fires. But the last story never ends.\",\"No one builds like that anymore. Maybe no one should.\",\"The dead there weren't buried to rest. They were buried to wait.\",\"You hear music sometimes. Horns and drums, like a feast starting. There's no feast.\",\"Even the air inside that mountain feels heavy, like the mountain's trying to keep its secrets.\",\"A chieftain sleeps there with his entire warband around him. Or maybe they just pretend to sleep.\",\"The bones are dressed in gold and furs, same as in life. And they guard it with the same hands, too.\"]"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007413000,
    "key": "c66d755da47f72ffc7d55c86bd3d063b0c610b578328047a9fb1429ea69c33ff",
    "original": "Ancestor's Reach",
    "translation": "先祖之域",
    "context": "getroottable().Const.World.LocationNames.RF_DraugrBarrows = [\"Barrows of the Old Wyrd\",\"Frozen Cairns\",\"Veiled Barrows\",\"Barrow-Moot Meadows\",\"Snowmarked Ruin\",\"Drowned Hearth Graves\",\"Whisperfen Hollow\",\"Duskfield Graves\",\"Helskeld\",\"Coldshade Hollow\",\"The Howling Mound\",\"Gravenhill\",\"Barrowmark\",\"Oathstone Barrows\",\"Vigil of the First Sons\",\"Ironwake Barrows\",\"Whispering Stones\",\"Ancestor's Reach\",\"Elder's Hollow\",\"Barrow of the Nine Shields\",\"Sigfrid's Longrest\",\"The King's Bonehill\",\"Kinmourne Hollow\",\"Grove of Remembering\",\"Dreadwake Mound\",\"Hollow Cairn\",\"Barrow of Ash and Bone\",\"Stonefather's Mound\",\"Coldwake Barrow\",\"The Shaded Hill\",\"Silentwatch Cairn\",\"Dustbound Hollow\",\"Windgrave\",\"The Elder's Rest\",\"Wyrdstone Mound\",\"Pale Hearth Barrow\",\"Gravenrise\",\"Whispering Barrow\",\"The Moss-Touched Cairn\",\"Hill of Broken Names\",\"Kinwatch Mound\",\"Rootwound Hollow\",\"Emberrest\",\"The Frost Cairn\",\"The Cracked Barrow\",\"Quietwake\",\"Thawgrave\",\"Hushed Earth\",\"Barrow of Bitter Sleep\",\"The Low Cairn\",\"Rest of the Faded Banner\",\"The Hollow Step\",\"Cairn of the Lost Sons\",\"The Unearthed Place\"]"
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007413001,
    "key": "f1721ff00e4e955624e33313a004dc2a1ade999217d3fc822159f7b38772cf85",
    "original": "Barbarians used to bury their kin up there. Now they don't even look that way.",
    "translation": "那儿以前是蛮族埋葬亲人的地方。可如今他们甚至都不朝那个方向看一眼。",
    "context": "getroottable().Const.World.RF_LocationDescriptions.RF_DraugrBarrows = [\"Just a hump of stone in the hills, overgrown and wind-worn. Still, the crows won't go near it.\",\"Some old barrow cracked open by frost or fools. Smells of cold iron and old prayers.\",\"They say it's just a family mound. But if so, it's a loud one.\",\"It looks like nothing but a lumpy hill until you see the stones laid in a circle beneath the moss.\",\"No one's tended the graves for generations, but there's fresh scratch marks on the stones.\",\"One of the men saw smoke curling from the mound at dawn. There's no chimney under earth, is there?\",\"That's where the cold seeps from, they say. Cold and something else.\",\"Barbarians used to bury their kin up there. Now they don't even look that way.\",\"You'll find old coins and maybe a blade or two in the dirt. Just mind what you wake up reaching for them.\",\"Go ahead and dig. Just don't expect to be the only one moving when the shovel hits stone.\"]"
  },
  {
